WEBVTT

00:10.743 --> 00:13.712
I know you're hiding in there!

00:13.779 --> 00:15.713
Come on out, you thief!

00:16.516 --> 00:19.280
How dare you call me a thief.

00:21.320 --> 00:23.413
I'm begging you.

00:23.990 --> 00:24.820
Please.

00:25.491 --> 00:28.289
I'm begging you to help us.

00:29.095 --> 00:34.226
This first encounter that took
place on April 2nd, 2002...

00:34.300 --> 00:38.600
...was to significantly change
the course of my life.

00:53.019 --> 00:55.920
So, where is this flower garden?

00:56.389 --> 00:57.447
It's right nearby.

00:57.657 --> 01:00.854
I wouldn't call it a flower garden,
but there are flowers.

01:02.895 --> 01:04.157
Are they real?

01:04.664 --> 01:05.790
Uh, yeah.

01:07.199 --> 01:08.689
I see. I see.

01:08.901 --> 01:09.833
In other words...

01:11.804 --> 01:16.764
Underground
Beneath the city of Tokyo is
a world called the "Underground."

01:17.143 --> 01:19.907
And you two escaped from there.

01:20.212 --> 01:21.702
Is that the story?

01:22.081 --> 01:22.809
I suppose.

01:23.215 --> 01:25.547
But why did you escape?

01:25.918 --> 01:26.885
Well, that's...

01:28.387 --> 01:30.014
I guess you have your reasons.

01:30.222 --> 01:34.022
If you don't want to talk about it,
I won't push.

01:40.533 --> 01:44.731
Ruri, don't you want
to see some real flowers?

01:51.444 --> 01:54.072
Let's escape from
the Underground.

01:58.384 --> 02:00.477
That's incredible!
Truly incredible!

02:00.886 --> 02:03.650
If what these two are saying
is true...

02:03.723 --> 02:05.691
...this would be the first
great discovery of the century!

02:05.758 --> 02:06.816
Rumina!

02:06.959 --> 02:07.425
Huh?

02:07.860 --> 02:08.588
Where's Rumina?

02:09.061 --> 02:10.494
He was here a second ago.

02:10.830 --> 02:12.092
And Ruri's gone, too!

02:12.765 --> 02:15.632
Where could they have gone?

02:15.801 --> 02:19.703
Don't tell me
he took Ruri outside!

02:23.809 --> 02:28.269
The abandoned subway line
leads into darkness.

02:28.781 --> 02:31.648
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

02:31.917 --> 02:35.614
...beneath Tokyo,
this nation's capital...

02:35.921 --> 02:39.448
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

02:40.092 --> 02:44.028
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

03:06.686 --> 03:10.087
yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

03:10.156 --> 03:13.956
kokoro umore naku nari sou

03:14.026 --> 03:17.484
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

03:17.563 --> 03:20.031
taisetsu na koto wa

03:20.099 --> 03:22.294
oshiete yo

03:22.368 --> 03:23.801
ne

03:24.270 --> 03:28.900
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:28.974 --> 03:34.606
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:34.680 --> 03:38.343
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:38.417 --> 03:42.012
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:42.088 --> 03:45.421
osoreru koto nante nani

03:45.491 --> 03:49.291
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:49.361 --> 03:52.819
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:52.898 --> 03:56.459
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

03:56.535 --> 03:59.902
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

03:59.972 --> 04:03.339
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

04:03.409 --> 04:09.609
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai.

04:23.462 --> 04:23.996
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life

04:23.996 --> 04:26.932
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life.

04:26.932 --> 04:29.992
Resurrection - The Maiden of Life

04:37.376 --> 04:41.073
So, this is a real flower garden?

04:41.714 --> 04:44.012
Well, not really.

04:44.784 --> 04:48.413
Gramps... He hasn't been
tending the garden lately.

04:49.355 --> 04:52.085
So, this is a flower garden...

04:53.425 --> 04:54.414
She's crying.

04:54.994 --> 04:58.088
Did I...
Did I make this girl cry?

04:58.764 --> 05:02.860
Oh, no! I can't believe it!

05:03.335 --> 05:08.238
I've never, ever made a girl cry
in my whole life!

05:09.708 --> 05:10.766
Don't cry!

05:10.843 --> 05:11.741
Please don't cry!

05:12.645 --> 05:17.344
I'll take you to as many
flower gardens as you want!

05:18.250 --> 05:19.274
Really?

05:20.753 --> 05:22.380
Yeah, I promise.

05:22.822 --> 05:24.187
So, please.

05:25.291 --> 05:25.882
O-Okay.

05:27.092 --> 05:28.525
Thank you!

05:30.362 --> 05:32.057
Boy, is she ever cute.

05:32.164 --> 05:35.099
My desire for a rose-colored
academic life may be dead...

05:35.167 --> 05:38.625
...but if this girl ends up
living here with me...

05:38.704 --> 05:42.538
...I might be able to have a
rose-colored life after all.

05:42.908 --> 05:47.743
Maybe I'm the luckiest
senior high student in Japan.

05:47.880 --> 05:49.211
You fool!

05:50.783 --> 05:52.250
That hurt!

05:52.384 --> 05:53.749
What're you doing?!

05:53.819 --> 05:55.787
What do you think you're doing?!

05:55.855 --> 05:57.755
Dragging Ruri out here!

05:57.823 --> 05:59.654
What if something happened?!

05:59.725 --> 06:03.855
Is that the attitude of someone
taking shelter in my house?!

06:06.031 --> 06:07.293
Damn!

06:07.466 --> 06:09.764
I want my rose-colored life...

06:09.835 --> 06:12.736
...and I can't have this
violent little blond in the way!

06:13.172 --> 06:16.107
What are you all doing out here?

06:16.275 --> 06:17.299
Him, too.

06:17.376 --> 06:22.006
I figured that I'd show
this girl the flower garden.

06:22.514 --> 06:25.449
But Gramps hasn't been
taking care of it.

06:25.618 --> 06:28.143
I brought her here,
but the flowers are wilted.

06:28.220 --> 06:29.744
And there're weeds everywhere.

06:29.822 --> 06:31.687
- It's a real mess.
- I must've imagined that.

06:32.024 --> 06:34.424
I hope you're telling the truth.

06:34.493 --> 06:38.395
If you try anything funny
with Ruri...

06:38.464 --> 06:39.396
...I'll kill you.

06:39.765 --> 06:40.390
Huh?

06:43.802 --> 06:45.565
Wh-What do you want?

06:45.905 --> 06:48.703
I'm counting on you
to protect Ruri.

06:49.675 --> 06:52.109
Take Ruri and get out of here!

06:53.512 --> 06:55.207
What's the deal with her?

06:55.681 --> 06:56.409
Who knows.

06:57.616 --> 06:58.583
Chelsea...

07:01.320 --> 07:02.651
I messed up.

07:05.257 --> 07:08.021
They were quicker
at finding us than I thought.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.457
That's Seki for you.

07:12.932 --> 07:19.098
It was a real hassle finding you,
traitor Chelsea Rorec.

07:23.375 --> 07:24.967
What?! Who're these guys?!

07:25.210 --> 07:29.408
You may be clever,
but you're just a girl on foot.

07:29.481 --> 07:32.211
I didn't think you'd get that far.

07:33.018 --> 07:36.545
To think you were hiding
in the house of a surface dweller.

07:37.356 --> 07:39.085
Surface dweller?

07:41.427 --> 07:43.088
These guys come
onto my property...

07:43.162 --> 07:45.687
...and start going on about
something I don't understand!

07:45.764 --> 07:48.824
That's because you didn't hear
Chelsea explain it to us.

07:48.901 --> 07:51.893
Those people are probably...

07:52.338 --> 07:54.397
...the ones who are after us.

07:55.307 --> 07:58.071
H-Hey, Blondie.
What's all this about?

07:58.310 --> 08:01.609
You idiot! Stay out of it!
Just get Ruri out of here!

08:02.114 --> 08:04.207
But what about you?

08:04.850 --> 08:06.545
Never mind me!

08:08.587 --> 08:10.452
Protect Ruri!

08:10.656 --> 08:12.283
Go! My men!

08:13.359 --> 08:14.826
H-Hey! Hang on!

08:15.160 --> 08:17.355
You can't fight those guys off
by yourself!

08:19.798 --> 08:22.824
You should do something
about that getup!

08:22.901 --> 08:26.200
That black, cockroach-like outfit...

08:26.271 --> 08:28.501
...gives me strength just to look at it!

08:35.914 --> 08:37.176
Amazing.

08:37.249 --> 08:40.150
Guys are flying off
from her kicks and punches.

08:40.219 --> 08:43.677
That power is fit for the
Guinness Book of Records.

08:43.756 --> 08:45.223
I guess I didn't have to worry.

08:49.661 --> 08:54.621
You use your soldiers
to sap me of my strength first.

08:54.967 --> 08:57.094
You sure like to play dirty.

08:57.369 --> 08:58.336
Huh, Seki?

08:58.404 --> 08:59.928
You saw that, huh?

09:00.005 --> 09:01.870
But thanks to that...

09:03.142 --> 09:05.337
...there's something
I can really look forward to!

09:10.115 --> 09:11.639
Flames from both hands?!

09:11.717 --> 09:12.911
Is that for real?!

09:13.352 --> 09:14.614
Take this!

09:15.854 --> 09:17.289
Crimson Fire
Crimson fire!

09:17.289 --> 09:18.051
Crimson fire!

09:19.058 --> 09:20.923
Amazing! The flames are flying!

09:21.660 --> 09:22.718
Watch it!

09:23.562 --> 09:25.325
Watch it, Blondie!

09:25.697 --> 09:26.721
That's nothing!

09:29.802 --> 09:30.962
There!

09:34.173 --> 09:35.765
She crushed the flame?!

09:39.812 --> 09:42.804
So you crushed my flame
with your gravity, huh?

09:43.148 --> 09:45.275
That's quite a skill.

09:47.886 --> 09:49.319
Gravity?

09:50.022 --> 09:54.015
Does that mean
the punch I took before...

09:54.093 --> 09:56.357
...and all those guys
being blown away by her is...

09:58.430 --> 10:00.625
Are you surprised, Rumina?

10:01.600 --> 10:05.866
In the Underground, there are
people who have powers...

10:05.938 --> 10:09.066
...like "flame," "water,"
and "lightning."

10:09.942 --> 10:13.673
Chelsea's power of gravity
is quite rare.

10:14.947 --> 10:17.711
My strength hasn't recovered yet.

10:20.119 --> 10:21.586
I've got to finish this off quick!

10:25.858 --> 10:26.756
Why, you! Annoying little...!

10:26.825 --> 10:27.883
Gotcha!

10:28.427 --> 10:30.725
At this range,
you can't use the flame!

10:37.202 --> 10:39.762
Then I'll just have to use
my claws of flame!

10:43.775 --> 10:47.006
Chelsea's got the advantage
in close combat!

10:47.412 --> 10:49.277
I have to get some distance
from her!

10:49.781 --> 10:51.772
Sorry, Seki.

10:52.317 --> 10:55.115
I'm going to have to
finish you off!

11:03.495 --> 11:04.792
Finish!

11:16.175 --> 11:19.804
It seems like you've
run out of power.

11:23.248 --> 11:24.146
Blondie!

11:24.316 --> 11:25.305
Chelsea!

11:36.395 --> 11:38.260
This is bad.

11:40.799 --> 11:44.792
After escaping to the surface
and wiping out my soldiers...

11:44.870 --> 11:47.737
...you've reached your limit
in battle with me.

11:48.207 --> 11:51.370
I think you were a little
overzealous with your power.

11:53.545 --> 11:58.710
Now, I'll give you a death
that's suited to a traitor.

12:01.853 --> 12:02.717
Hell Fire!

12:04.656 --> 12:05.588
This is...!

12:11.463 --> 12:13.693
The flames of hell surround you.

12:13.765 --> 12:16.063
The flames burn and burn...

12:16.134 --> 12:19.467
...sucking up the oxygen
within the ring.

12:20.339 --> 12:23.775
One within the ring can't move
even slightly...

12:23.842 --> 12:26.470
...and their body shall be burned
to a crisp.

12:29.114 --> 12:30.775
Ru-Ruri...

12:32.851 --> 12:34.216
What a pathetic sight.

12:35.020 --> 12:36.112
Chelsea!

12:44.529 --> 12:49.091
Now, enjoy the slow terror
of death.

12:49.801 --> 12:51.530
Wait, mister!

12:53.538 --> 12:57.736
You won't get any bragging
rights for killing a suicidal girl.

12:58.510 --> 12:59.943
I'll be your opponent!

13:00.279 --> 13:01.268
Rumina!

13:01.680 --> 13:03.170
That's crazy, Rumina.

13:03.248 --> 13:05.045
These aren't regular people!

13:05.684 --> 13:07.914
We can't win against them!

13:08.587 --> 13:09.519
Shut up!

13:09.721 --> 13:13.623
I can't just sit and watch
while he picks on a girl!

13:14.226 --> 13:15.625
Y-You fool!

13:16.061 --> 13:18.120
Take Ruri and get away!

13:18.196 --> 13:21.791
He isn't someone
a surface dweller can beat!

13:23.769 --> 13:25.634
I might not look like much...

13:25.704 --> 13:29.003
...but I was the "King of Fighters"
back in junior high!

13:29.274 --> 13:30.206
Oh?

13:31.343 --> 13:32.901
That's impressive.

13:55.701 --> 13:56.895
No way...

13:57.269 --> 14:01.069
I was so close to having
my rose-colored life...

14:01.139 --> 14:02.936
...living with the cute girl...

14:03.008 --> 14:05.135
...but now I'm going to die.

14:08.180 --> 14:10.740
No!

14:14.519 --> 14:15.986
Rumina...

14:16.054 --> 14:17.851
Rumina! Rumina!

14:18.457 --> 14:20.823
Come on, Rumina!

14:21.860 --> 14:22.622
I-I'm sorry.

14:23.495 --> 14:28.660
After all that tough talk,
I couldn't even help you.

14:29.301 --> 14:30.563
It's embarrassing.

14:32.671 --> 14:33.501
No, no...

14:33.572 --> 14:34.766
Not at all.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.829
That's not true!

14:35.907 --> 14:38.569
Don't say things like that!

14:38.643 --> 14:41.407
I thought I was confident.

14:42.481 --> 14:45.973
But the King of Fighters
goes down with one hit.

14:46.385 --> 14:48.319
It's shameful.

14:49.788 --> 14:50.277
The fool...

14:50.922 --> 14:52.287
Sorry.

14:52.357 --> 14:53.984
I made you cry again.

14:57.095 --> 15:01.225
I promised to take you
to a flower garden...

15:14.546 --> 15:17.413
Now let's go, Maiden of Life.

15:18.350 --> 15:19.442
Come to the Underground with us.

15:28.860 --> 15:30.088
I'm the one to blame!

15:30.695 --> 15:33.255
I'm the one that's drawing
everyone into this!

15:33.632 --> 15:34.690
Ginnosuke...

15:35.500 --> 15:36.660
Chelsea...

15:37.736 --> 15:39.067
Rumina...

15:41.139 --> 15:43.107
I'm so sorry, everyone.

15:43.275 --> 15:47.371
Let me use my power and...

15:48.180 --> 15:49.147
Ruri!

15:58.523 --> 15:59.649
No!

16:00.258 --> 16:01.725
Ruri!

16:09.768 --> 16:12.100
So soft. The beautiful light.

16:12.304 --> 16:14.272
And in so many waves.

16:31.256 --> 16:34.191
I've heard about this,
but I never believed it.

16:34.259 --> 16:38.286
This power that only
the Maiden of Life possesses...

16:39.231 --> 16:40.459
...the power of resurrection!

16:41.733 --> 16:43.291
N-No, Ruri!

16:43.368 --> 16:45.802
That power! That power...

16:46.605 --> 16:50.006
...is an unstable unknown power
that no one has...

16:50.075 --> 16:51.940
...so far succeeded in harnessing!

16:52.277 --> 16:55.940
Using such a dangerous power
can mean the end of your life!

17:12.297 --> 17:14.060
What? What is this feeling?

17:14.900 --> 17:16.868
It feels like my body's burning up.

17:18.436 --> 17:19.630
Rumina!

17:19.704 --> 17:20.671
Did someone call me?

17:21.773 --> 17:22.671
Rumina!

17:23.441 --> 17:24.635
That voice is...

17:29.614 --> 17:30.546
Ruri?

17:31.650 --> 17:32.116
Ruri?!

17:32.817 --> 17:37.584
No wonder we sacrifice men
for the prize of this girl.

17:39.024 --> 17:40.116
I understand.

17:40.191 --> 17:44.651
So this power must be the key
to the Company's plans.

17:47.566 --> 17:49.625
Ruri, I'm sorry...

17:51.002 --> 17:52.765
You must be just about done.

18:00.312 --> 18:03.247
What?! How did
my Flame Revolver go out?!

18:03.915 --> 18:05.143
What caused that?!

18:05.550 --> 18:07.040
What is this wind?!

18:15.060 --> 18:17.153
The power of
the Maiden of Life...

18:17.228 --> 18:19.788
I've seen something
that's truly interesting.

18:20.732 --> 18:22.666
What are you going on about?

18:23.168 --> 18:24.294
Rumina!

18:24.536 --> 18:25.901
You're alive?!

18:26.204 --> 18:28.069
You're not a ghost,
are you?

18:28.139 --> 18:29.128
I'm real.

18:29.207 --> 18:32.142
Yeah, he got me good.

18:32.210 --> 18:35.043
But I heard the voice of Ruri.

18:38.483 --> 18:39.245
Ginnosuke!

18:39.317 --> 18:40.215
I'll leave Ruri with you!

18:40.285 --> 18:41.183
All right!

18:43.521 --> 18:45.682
All right!
How about another match?!

18:46.024 --> 18:48.618
You sure like punishment.

18:55.967 --> 18:57.025
Wind!

18:59.504 --> 19:00.869
How could this happen?!

19:00.939 --> 19:03.669
A power that can
control the movement of air?!

19:04.275 --> 19:06.641
How can some
kid surface dweller do it?!

19:06.845 --> 19:09.643
I'm paying you back for before!

19:14.886 --> 19:16.251
Wh-What was that?!

19:16.921 --> 19:18.081
There's no mistake!

19:18.156 --> 19:20.124
That was wind coming
from his sword.

19:20.625 --> 19:22.183
D-Did you see that?!

19:22.260 --> 19:24.922
I wield the Sword of Wind!

19:28.233 --> 19:30.997
It looks like you want
to experience my sword.

19:31.069 --> 19:33.629
No, I'll pass this time.

19:34.506 --> 19:38.442
But, kid,
even though I'm withdrawing...

19:38.510 --> 19:43.209
...another Master Warrior will
come searching for the Maiden.

19:45.183 --> 19:46.616
Chelsea Rorec...

19:47.118 --> 19:48.983
...and Rumina, was it?

19:49.487 --> 19:53.856
Keep a good eye on the Maiden
until we meet next time!

19:54.726 --> 19:55.852
H-Hey!

19:55.960 --> 19:57.222
Ow, ow, ow!

20:00.265 --> 20:01.323
He disappeared?

20:01.399 --> 20:02.889
Rumina!

20:07.839 --> 20:09.864
That was impressive, Rumina!

20:10.375 --> 20:11.842
But how's the girl?

20:12.444 --> 20:13.206
Don't worry.

20:15.647 --> 20:16.705
Rumina...

20:17.682 --> 20:19.047
She's sleeping well.

20:19.651 --> 20:20.242
Yeah.

20:20.351 --> 20:21.818
You guys...

20:23.521 --> 20:26.490
It's burning pretty good.
You going to leave it?

20:29.027 --> 20:30.187
Oh, no! That's right!

20:30.261 --> 20:31.353
We've got to put it out!

20:31.429 --> 20:33.021
Hey, Blondie! Give us a hand!

20:33.098 --> 20:34.565
My house is burning!

20:34.632 --> 20:36.964
What're you talking about?
It's your house!

20:43.808 --> 20:48.541
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:48.613 --> 20:54.449
migakareru machi nami wo

20:54.519 --> 21:06.761
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:07.732 --> 21:18.575
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:18.643 --> 21:30.783
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.089 --> 21:39.793
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:39.864 --> 21:43.630
kikou to shita

21:43.701 --> 21:51.870
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:51.943 --> 22:00.681
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.261 --> 22:12.058
Preview

22:13.965 --> 22:15.432
Nothing seems to work.

22:16.100 --> 22:18.034
The power of wind that I had.

22:18.102 --> 22:20.127
If I'm able to master that power...

22:20.205 --> 22:21.900
...I'd be able to protect Ruri.

22:22.674 --> 22:24.938
Try to remember, how it all went!

22:25.376 --> 22:27.503
How I felt when that wind
came to me!

22:28.246 --> 22:29.213
Who are you?!

22:29.380 --> 22:31.348
Are you the new enemy?!

22:32.250 --> 22:34.844
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.919 --> 22:35.653
..."The Awakening -
When the Wind Blows."

22:35.653 --> 22:37.455
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows
..."The Awakening -
When the Wind Blows."

22:37.455 --> 22:40.015
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows
